00:35:30.000 --> 00:36:33.000
My God, how much blood does a person have? He lost consciousness and was taken to hospital, where he died less than three hours later. While no one saw the shooting take place, an unidentified man was spotted standing on the rocks near the patio shortly before the swindles arrived. 15 minutes later, another witness saw a man running at full speed along Del Monte Avenue away from the beachfront. It couldn't be ascertained exactly what type of firearm was used in the crime. A sniper rifle correlated with the crime scene's layout and the position of the shooter. However, the erratic gunfire and execution-style headshots were more in line with someone wielding a handgun. Although Johnny's wallet had been stolen, robbery didn't appear to have been the killer's true motive.
天哪，一个人有多少血？他失去了知觉，被送到医院，不到三小时后死亡。虽然没有人看到枪击事件的发生，但在斯温德尔夫妇到达之前，曾看到一名身份不明的男子站在露台附近的岩石上。15分钟后，另一名目击者看到一名男子沿德尔蒙特大道全速奔跑，远离海滨。无法确定犯罪中究竟使用了哪种火器。狙击步枪与犯罪现场的布局和枪手的位置相吻合。然而，反复无常的枪击和行刑式的头部枪击更符合挥舞手枪的人。尽管强尼的钱包被偷了，但抢劫似乎并不是凶手的真正动机。

