00:36:33.000 --> 00:37:38.000
Johnny was so short on cash that he'd started painting for his landlord in lieu of paying rent, making it unlikely that he had much money on him. Robbery might have been the killer's secondary motive, or merely an afterthought intended to confuse investigators. There was little in the victim's lives that indicated the crime was personal. Johnny and Joyce had barely settled into their apartment, where they kept to themselves. They were making the most of their honeymoon period before Johnny reported for naval duty aboard a radar picket ship. Nothing in their backgrounds pointed to someone they knew wanting to kill them. Police concluded that the crime was a senseless thrill-killing committed by a psychopathic killer whose only motive was excitement. With the murders of Johnny and Joyce Swindle, a pattern was beginning to emerge.
强尼手头很紧，以至于他开始为房东画画来代替交租，这使得他身上不太可能有很多钱。抢劫可能是凶手的次要动机，或者只是为了混淆调查人员视线的事后想法。受害者的生活中几乎没有什么迹象表明这起犯罪是针对个人的。强尼和乔伊斯刚安顿在他们的公寓里，平时深居简出。在强尼作为海军雷达警戒舰服役之前，他们正在充分享受蜜月期。他们的背景中没有任何迹象表明他们认识的人想要杀害他们。警方得出结论，这起犯罪是一起毫无意义的快感杀人案，由一个唯一的动机就是刺激的精神病杀手所为。随着强尼和乔伊斯·斯温德尔的谋杀案发生，一种模式开始显现。

